@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="container mt-4 mb-5">

    <h1 class="mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>

    <p>
        Mart Ops respects your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal information.
        This privacy policy explains how information is collected, used and protected when using
        the Mart Ops website and associated mobile applications.
    </p>

    <h4 class="mt-4">Information we collect</h4>

    <p>
        Mart Ops may collect information required to provide and operate the service, including:
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li>Name and contact information</li>
        <li>User account and login information</li>
        <li>Company and branch information</li>
        <li>Customer and contract information entered by authorised users</li>
        <li>Job, survey and fitting information</li>
        <li>Photographs, drawings and signatures captured while carrying out work</li>
        <li>Technical information required to maintain the security and operation of the service</li>
    </ul>

    <h4 class="mt-4">How information is used</h4>

    <p>
        Information held within Mart Ops is used only for the operation of the service,
        including managing jobs, contracts, surveys, fitting work, customer records and
        associated documentation.
    </p>

    <p>
        We do not sell personal information to third parties.
    </p>

    <h4 class="mt-4">Data security</h4>

    <p>
        Reasonable technical and organisational measures are used to protect information
        against unauthorised access, loss, misuse or disclosure.
    </p>

    <h4 class="mt-4">Data sharing</h4>

    <p>
        Information may be processed by service providers used to operate Mart Ops,
        such as hosting and infrastructure providers. Information will only be shared
        where necessary to provide the service or where required by law.
    </p>

    <h4 class="mt-4">Data retention</h4>

    <p>
        Information is retained for as long as necessary to provide the Mart Ops service
        and to meet any applicable legal, contractual or business requirements.
    </p>

    <h4 class="mt-4">Your rights</h4>

    <p>
        Depending on the circumstances, individuals may have rights over their personal
        information, including the right to request access, correction or deletion of
        information held about them.
    </p>

    <h4 class="mt-4">Cookies</h4>

    <p>
        The Mart Ops website may use cookies that are necessary for authentication,
        security and the correct operation of the website.
    </p>

    <h4 class="mt-4">Changes to this policy</h4>

    <p>
        This privacy policy may be updated from time to time to reflect changes to the
        Mart Ops service or applicable legal requirements.
    </p>

    <h4 class="mt-4">Contact</h4>

    <p>
        If you have any questions about this privacy policy or how your information is
        handled, please contact the Mart Ops administrator.
    </p>

    <hr class="mt-5" />

    <p class="text-muted small">
        Last updated: September 2026
    </p>

</div>